摘录/摘要：  
- 文本称“Ring of Nestor is a gold signet ring first described by the 
archaeologist Arthur Evans”，明确其作为 Evans 命名与首次发表的对象。  
- 对戒指发现后引发的真伪讨论有简要描述：“Since its discovery, the ring's 
authenticity has [been 
